From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] scoring: import the builtin timestamp fallback

The source-timestamp scoring change uses the ROS builtin Time message when
there is no estimate stamp, but its import was omitted. Keep the source
checkout untouched and apply this compatibility fix to the staged image input.

---
 umd_uas/scoring.py | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/umd_uas/scoring.py b/umd_uas/scoring.py
--- a/umd_uas/scoring.py
+++ b/umd_uas/scoring.py
@@ -66,3 +66,4 @@
 # python imports
+from builtin_interfaces.msg import Time
 import math
 import time
